SUMMARY:2026 Good Brick Tour
DTSTAMP:20260824T033950Z
DTSTART:20261114T180000Z
DESCRIPTION:Save the date for Preservation Houston's 2026 Good Brick Tour\,
	 returning Saturday and Sunday\, November 14 and 15. Now in its 13th year\
	, this annual self-guided tour offers a rare opportunity to step inside so
	me of Houston's most remarkable historic places and experience the city's 
	architectural heritage firsthand.\n\nhttps://www.preservationhouston.org/c
	alendar/2026/11/14/2026-good-brick-tour
URL:https://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/11/14/2026-good-brick
	-tour
